  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_aa6a8d99-b027-44db-9b03-57683f127936.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"402\" height=\"199\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">本模组会在特定时间让你敲钟时获得增益效果！</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">白天敲钟可获得【迅捷】效果！</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">正午敲钟可获得【生命恢复】效果</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">夜晚敲钟可获得【抗性提升】效果</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">午夜敲钟会使周围的生物获得【发光】效果。</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>",
